Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Create targeted acquisition or annotation tasks, rerun audits on new material, and assemble a release manifest with known limits. Freeze splits by source and world family, prevent leakage, and require owner approval for the specific release use.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
